# Blueberry package mirrors
#
# Canonical list of mirror base URLs for the `core` repository. Put the origin
# first, then mirrors, on one line in the client's /etc/bpm/repos.conf:
#
#   core <origin> <mirror1> <mirror2> ...
#
# bpm tries each in order and fails over when one is unreachable. Keep this file
# as the source of truth; clients can copy the URLs below.

# origin (built + published from OBS via tools/mkrepo.sh in the blueberry repo)
https://repo.blueberry.lan/x86_64

# mirrors (each runs bpm-mirror-sync against the origin)
# http://mirror1.blueberry.lan/x86_64
# http://mirror2.blueberry.lan/x86_64
